            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Thank you for your sentence and for exploring the cats of the world with us. Whichever group you chose, all of these animals share the same body plan, shaped over millions of years for the ambush, and many of them depend today on the choices people make about the places they live. If you are curious, come back and explore the other groups too."
